      "content": "hey i really need some help. something weird is happening at work and i feel like i'm losing my mind. everything is starting to feel so... intentional. like, the cafeteria switched to the diet menu right when i mentioned my allergies, then my payroll email was delayed by two days for no reason, and now they moved my weekly sync to 4pm on a Friday when i have nothing on my calendar. it's all so small but it feels like a pattern. i feel like they're trying to push me out or something. am i just being paranoid or is there something more to this?",
