      "content": "Absolutely, documenting every detail is crucial. Start by keeping a detailed journal of all the events, including dates, times, and descriptions of what happened. Take screenshots of emails, cafeteria menus, and any other relevant communications. If possible, gather statements from colleagues who might have noticed these changes or any other unusual occurrences. This evidence can help build a strong case to show a pattern of behavior that supports your concerns. Remember, you're not alone in this, and your feelings are valid. Keep pushing forward, and trust that justice will prevail.",
